130	   * continue-as-new chain would return several generations' streams under
131	   * pairwise-colliding `(activity, attempt)` coordinates, which is the exact
132	   * ambiguity the run axis exists to remove. The server refuses a run-less body.
133	   */
134	  async listStreams(
135	    namespace: Namespace,
