11	/**
12	 * The detail view's read of ONE workflow's server-projected summary (#211).
13	 *
14	 * The summary is projected from the run's full recorded history server-side, so
15	 * it is the authority for the run's current `display_name` — a fold over the
16	 * loaded history WINDOW can only see the events in hand, and a run named at
17	 * start with more events than the window holds would otherwise read as unnamed.
18	 * History is not requested here; the windowed history endpoint already loads it.
19	 */
